  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the security and justice sectors to ensure quality service delivery in Guinea-Bissau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action intends to strengthen the rule of law &amp;amp; the justice system and to contribute to the fight against illicit trafficking &amp;amp; organised crime.The approach involves the following specific objectives:SO1: Improve Guinea-Bissau&#xbf;s internal security governance for more effective, accountable and human rights compliant police services.SO2: Improve an effective and inclusive access to justice, notably towards equitable provision of quality justice services, including in the regions outside Bissau and for women and vulnerable people.</narrative>
  </description>
